        "name": "Ezekieli 16:19",
        "verse": "Mkate wangu niliokupa, unga mzuri, na mafuta, na asali, nilivyokulisha, ukaviweka mbele yao viwe harufu ya kupendeza; na ndivyo vilivyokuwa; asema Bwana MUNGU. "
